# NexEstate — Project Rules

## Core Constraints

- **Never** create external sync, copy, or bundle scripts (e.g. `sync.sh`, `bundle.js`, file-copy utilities). All application code lives **only** under `src/`.
- Use the standard **React 18 + TypeScript + Vite 6 + Tailwind CSS v4** folder layout.
- Split UI into **small, modular components** under `src/components/`.
- Use **clean, relative imports** that resolve correctly with Vite — no broken or alias-only paths unless already configured in the project.
- Full **RTL (Hebrew)** support and a modern **Dark Mode** design throughout.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Frontend | React 18, TypeScript, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS v4 |
| Backend | Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage, Edge Functions) |
| Routing | React Router v7 |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Email | Resend (via Edge Functions) |
| OAuth | @sticklightapp/app-auth |

## Folder Structure

```
src/
├── App.tsx                 # Route definitions
├── providers.tsx           # App-wide providers
├── theme.css               # Design tokens (colors, fonts)
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                 # Button, Card, Input, Badge, FilterBar, SlidePanel, EmptyState
│   ├── mobile/             # MobileBottomNav, etc.
│   ├── property/           # SharePropertyModal, property-specific UI
│   └── ProtectedRoute.tsx
├── contexts/
│   ├── AuthContext.tsx
│   └── ThemeContext.tsx
├── hooks/                  # usePropertyShares, useSigningLinks, useBodyScrollLock, …
├── pages/
│   ├── broker/
│   ├── buyer/
│   ├── admin/
│   └── …                   # One folder per role dashboard
├── data/                   # demoData.ts and static fixtures (if needed)
└── lib/                    # supabase client, helpers
```

## UI & Design

- **Direction:** `dir="rtl"` on root layout; Hebrew copy for all user-facing text.
- **Theme:** Dark-first palette from `src/theme.css`:
  - Primary `#3b82f6`, Success `#10b981`, Warning `#f59e0b`, Destructive `#ef4444`, Accent `#8b5cf6`
- **Components:** Rounded cards (`rounded-xl` / `rounded-2xl`), subtle borders, hover states on stat cards.
- **Stat cards:** Icon in colored circle + bold number + muted label; link to relevant route when applicable.
- **Sidebar:** Right-side in RTL; grouped sections with titles; active item uses `bg-primary/10 text-primary`.
- **Mobile:** Bottom nav via `MobileBottomNav`; "More" sheet for secondary links.
- Reuse existing UI primitives from `src/components/ui/` before adding new ones.

## User Roles & Routing

```typescript
type UserRole =
  | 'superadmin' | 'admin' | 'broker' | 'buyer' | 'developer'
  | 'owner' | 'investor' | 'manager' | 'receiver' | 'partner';
```

| Path prefix | Allowed roles |
|-------------|---------------|
| `/dashboard` | Any authenticated user (redirect by role) |
| `/broker/*` | broker, admin, superadmin, owner, manager, partner |
| `/buyer/*` | buyer, admin, superadmin |
| `/admin/*` | admin, superadmin |
| `/developer/*` | developer, admin, superadmin |
| `/owner/*` | owner, admin, superadmin |
| `/investor/*` | investor, admin, superadmin |
| `/manager/*` | manager, admin, superadmin |
| `/partner/*` | partner, admin, superadmin |

**Post-login redirect:** superadmin → `/broker`; admin → `/admin`; broker → `/broker`; owner/manager/partner → `/broker`; buyer → `/buyer`.

Protect routes with `ProtectedRoute`; never bypass role checks in the UI alone — rely on Supabase RLS server-side.

## Dashboard Layout (All Roles)

Shared shell: **Header** (greeting, bell, menu) + **Sidebar** (logo, nav sections, user card with avatar/name/email/logout) + **Main content**. On mobile, collapse sidebar and show bottom nav.

### Broker (`/broker/*`)

- **Sidebar sections:** ראשי (לוח בקרה, נכסים שלי, מכירות פומביות, התראות) · ניהול CRM (לקוחות, לידים, משימות, הסכמים — each with `+` quick-add) · ניהול נכסים (נכסים מנוהלים with dynamic property tree, דוחות) · חשבון (פרופיל, לוח אדמין if admin, הגדרות).
- **Home widgets:** 6 stat cards, occupancy + monthly income bar, upcoming tasks, managed properties list, recent signing links.
- **Data sources:** `properties`, `property_units`, `tenants`, `leases`, `clients`, `leads`, `tasks`, `notifications`, `signing_links`, `property_shares`.

### Buyer (`/buyer/*`)

- **Nav:** לוח בקרה, נכסים ששותפו, חיפוש (placeholder), מועדפים (placeholder), התראות, הגדרות.
- **Home:** stat cards (מועדפים, שותפו, מתאימים, התראות) + shared property cards from `property_shares`.

### Admin (`/admin/*`)

- **Nav:** לוח בקרה, ניהול נכסים, ניהול משתמשים, שיתופי נכסים, פניות תמיכה, ייבוא עסקאות, סטטוס מהיר (ממתינים/מאושרים/נדחויים), חזרה לדשבורד, הגדרות.
- **Home:** platform stats, weekly activity chart, role distribution, pending approvals, recent users.
- **Data sources:** `profiles`, `properties` (counts); extended stats marked TODO in spec.

## Data & Supabase

- All DB access through the Supabase client; respect **RLS policies**.
- Key tables: `profiles`, `properties`, `property_shares`, `pending_invites`, `property_units`, `tenants`, `leases`, `clients`, `leads`, `tasks`, `auctions`, `signing_links`, `notifications`.
- On login/register: **claim** pending invites → create `property_shares`, update role from `intended_role`.
- Property share permission levels: `view` | `edit` | `admin`.

## Edge Functions (server logic only — not in `src/`)

`notify-share`, `send-email`, `get-signing-link`, `complete-signing`, `generate-agreement-pdf`, `check-alerts`.

## Coding Standards

- **TypeScript:** Strict types for props, API responses, and enums (`property_kind`, `property_status`, `lead_status`, etc.).
- **Components:** One primary export per file; co-locate small helpers only when tightly coupled.
- **Hooks:** Data fetching and mutations in `src/hooks/`; keep pages thin.
- **No over-engineering:** Minimal diff; match existing patterns in neighboring files.
- **Comments:** Only for non-obvious business logic (invite claim flow, signing token handling, etc.).
- **Tests:** Add only when requested or for critical paths.

## Auth Flows

- Email + password and Google OAuth.
- Routes: `/login`, `/register`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/auth/callback`.
- Settings tabs (shared): פרופיל, סיסמא, התראות, תצוגה, פרטיות; role-specific tabs (business, billing, system) as per role.

## Public Pages

- Landing page (marketing): hero search, categories, recent deals, auctions, FAQ, footer.
- Digital signing: `/sign/:token` — public canvas signature, then reveal property details + PDF.

## What NOT to Do

- Do not add sync/bundle/copy scripts outside `src/`.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, API keys).
- Do not create monolithic page files when sections can be components.
- Do not use LTR-only layouts or hard-coded English strings in the dashboard UI.
- Do not skip RTL icon/label placement (icons on the correct side for Hebrew).
